{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_staffm_01_01",
      "hash": "e697afe7de4cf5dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊啊……\\n在11樓的社長沒事吧？\\c\\n……我好擔心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_staffm_01_02",
      "hash": "e697b2e7de4cfaf5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳救了社長。\\n不論做什麼也不足以表達\\r\\n我對[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的感謝之情啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_staffm_02_01",
      "hash": "1115a7dc94e43893",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "火箭隊盯上的是\\n必定能捉到寶可夢的精靈球！\\c\\n……我猜他們是想要\\n大量製造這種大師球吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_staffm_02_02",
      "hash": "1115a8dc94e43a46",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "因為這次的事件……\\n公司決定\\r\\n取消發售大師球了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_staffm_03_01",
      "hash": "0e26fbd76c64647e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不管是西爾佛還是寶可夢……\\n要是成了火箭隊的傀儡，\\r\\n那後果就不堪設想了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_staffm_03_02",
      "hash": "0e26fad76c6462cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真厲害！\\n聽說[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳把\\r\\n火箭隊那幫人趕跑了？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_stafff_01_01",
      "hash": "1df9a9528b42a8a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂……！\\n這裡很危險的！\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是來救我們的？\\r\\n……小孩子別做這種事！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_stafff_01_02",
      "hash": "1df9a6528b42a390",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "得救了！\\n謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_kanban_01",
      "hash": "cef63d77c514c564",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "西爾佛公司總部\\n７樓"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t011r0407_max",
      "hash": "ba9727e27849bfb5"
    }
  ]
}
